    <ThingDef ParentName="BEWH_ImperialThroneBase">
        <defName>BEWH_ImperialPsythrone</defName>
        <label>Imperial psythrone</label>
        <description>A potent meditation throne, modelled after the Emperor's Golden Throne on Terra. While it is nowhere near as powerful as the Terran equivalent (due to its use of ancient and arcane technology), it can certainly help a dignity-focused psycaster channel and train their psychic abilities.</description>
